  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of Sustainable Digital Systems for Skills Development and Employment Promotion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a master plan for a job information system to improve the government&apos;s ability to support employment in Rwanda, establishing a labour market data bank, improving the system, rebuilding an integrated job information system to integrate and automatically link information systems in the field of job information, providing equipment and core infrastructure support for system operation, strengthening cybersecurity, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the establishment of a sustainable labor market system based on strengthening digital transformation, such as improving employment support functions and developing vocational skills through the reconstruction of KORA system currently in operation&#xC815;&#xBCF4;&#xD654;&#xC2DC;&#xC2A4;&#xD15C;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xAD6C;&#xC9C1;&#xC790;&#xC640; &#xACE0;&#xC6A9;&#xC8FC;&#xAC04; &#xC5F0;&#xACB0; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xB85C;, &#xB514;&#xC9C0;&#xD138; &#xC804;&#xD658;&#xC5D0; &#xAE30;&#xBC18;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD560; &#xC77C;&#xC790;&#xB9AC; &#xC0DD;&#xD0DC;&#xACC4; &#xAD6C;&#xCD95;&#xC744; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0;&#xD558;&#xACE0; &#xC218;&#xC6D0;&#xAD6D; &#xCD5C;&#xC0C1;&#xC704; &#xC804;&#xB7B5;&#xC778; NST-1 &#xC591;&#xC9C8;&#xC758; &#xC77C;&#xC790;&#xB9AC; 150&#xB9CC;&#xAC1C; &#xCC3D;&#xCD9C;&#xC5D0; &#xAE30;&#xC5EC;</narrative>
  </description>
